Dear Chris,

Our organisation, FreightSafe, are the appointed claims administrators 
for your claim with Fastway Couriers on label number MS0000058291.

Please find a Letter of Acknowledgement attached regarding the goods 
that were lost, which will also include a unique claim number, which you 
can reference if you have any questions concerning your claim.

Importantly, please click on the link below, which will take you to the 
Fastway website, to complete a claim form. This link will expire in 14 
days, so please ensure it is completed in full in a timely manner so 
your claim can be reviewed.

https://my.freightsafe.com/aus/fastwayapp/claim-form.html?claim_number=RldZMzQ1ODU1

